{% doc %}
  Hierarchy-aware "shop by category" pills. Context is read entirely from
  the current collection's own metafields — no template/page branching
  needed:

  1. No school context (e.g. /collections/all) → top-level school list:
     "All" + every collection with school_primary_color set and no
     school_parent (Auburn, Arkansas, ...).
  2. A school hub (school_primary_color set, no school_parent — e.g.
     /collections/auburn) → that school's own type sub-collections: every
     collection whose school_parent equals the current handle.
  3. A type sub-collection (school_parent set — e.g.
     /collections/auburn-football) → sibling type collections sharing the
     same school_parent, plus a link back up to the parent school hub.

  frontpage and empty (products_count == 0) collections are excluded in
  every context — same rule as before, just now scoped per context instead
  of applied to every collection in the store.

  Shopify's storefront filters (collection.filters) can't do any of this:
  there's no "which collection" facet, because you're already inside one
  when using it. Jumping between collections is ordinary navigation
  between collection.url values, not a query param, so this renders plain
  links throughout.

  @param {collection} current - the collection currently being viewed
  @example
  {% render 'category-pills', current: collection %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign current_parent = current.metafields.custom.school_parent.value
  assign current_is_hub = false
  if current.metafields.custom.school_primary_color.value != blank and current_parent == blank
    assign current_is_hub = true
  endif
-%}

{%- capture pills -%}
  {%- if current_parent != blank -%}
    {%- assign parent_collection = collections[current_parent] -%}
    {%- if parent_collection -%}
      <a href="{{ parent_collection.url }}" class="category-pills__link category-pills__link--up">← All {{ parent_collection.title }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- elsif current_is_hub == false -%}
    <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="category-pills__link{% if current.handle == 'all' %} is-active{% endif %}">All</a>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- for cat in collections -%}
    {%- assign include = false -%}
    {%- assign cat_parent = cat.metafields.custom.school_parent.value -%}
    {%- if current_parent != blank -%}
      {%- if cat_parent == current_parent -%}{%- assign include = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif current_is_hub -%}
      {%- if cat_parent == current.handle -%}{%- assign include = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- if cat.metafields.custom.school_primary_color.value != blank and cat_parent == blank -%}{%- assign include = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cat.handle == 'frontpage' or cat.products_count == 0 -%}{%- assign include = false -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if include -%}
      <a href="{{ cat.url }}" class="category-pills__link{% if cat.handle == current.handle %} is-active{% endif %}">{{ cat.title }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{{ pills | strip }}
